First release should prioritize one polished ground, one locked camera, one complete 5-over match loop, core bowling deliveries, core batting shots, full bat-ball interaction, basic AI fielding/catching, running/run-outs, rules, scorecard and real-time 1v1. List later features separately, including additional stadiums, weather, more advanced shots, manual fielding, AI opponents, tournaments and longer formats. Do not allow cosmetics or progression to delay the core ball lifecycle.

